<!--
Behavior summary:
- Uses conditions directly when present.
- Falls back to categories derived from labels when conditions is empty.
- Uses max as DPL count.
- Uses sort as DPL ordermethod when provided.
- Uses reverse=true/yes to set order=descending.
- Uses showSpace to choose default display path when path is not set:
  showSpace set -> fullpagename, otherwise -> pagename.
-->
<!--#dplreplace is used to extract namespace prefix for showSpace=true. claude.ai:drop a plain marker span containing %PAGE% where you want the namespace shown, then post-process the entire DPL output with two chained #dplreplace calls — one to pull the namespace out of spans that have a colon, one to clean up the leftover markers on main-namespace pages (which have no colon to extract).-->
<!-- Important note about DISPLAYTITLE - currently a bug in DPL (https://github.com/Universal-Omega/DynamicPageList4/issues/572). If this is an issue, replace with #ask parser function-->
</noinclude><includeonly>
